       },
       "helpUri": "https://scout.docker.com/v/CVE-2026-89156?s=redhat&n=pcre2&ns=redhat&t=rpm&osn=redhatlinux&osv=8&vr=%3E%3D0",
       "help": {
        "text": "A flaw was found in PCRE2. An attacker can provide invalid UTF (Unicode Transformation Format) data, leading to an out-of-bounds read during a Just-In-Time (JIT) fallback. This vulnerability could potentially result in a denial of service.\n",
