       "shortDescription": {
        "text": "CVE-2026-89160: Out-of-bounds Read"
       },
       "helpUri": "https://scout.docker.com/v/CVE-2026-89160?s=redhat&n=pcre2&ns=redhat&t=rpm&osn=redhatlinux&osv=8&vr=%3E%3D0",
       "help": {
        "text": "A flaw was found in PCRE2, a library for processing regular expressions. A remote attacker could exploit this vulnerability by providing a specially crafted input that triggers an out-of-bounds read during pattern matching with invalid UTF (Unicode Transformation Format) characters. This could lead to a denial of service, making the affected system or application unavailable.\n",
