       "help": {
        "text": "A flaw was found in libtasn1. A remote attacker could exploit a stack-based buffer overflow vulnerability in the `asn1_expend_octet_string` function. This occurs due to a failure in validating the size of input data. Successful exploitation can lead to a Denial of Service (DoS) condition, making the affected system or application unavailable.\n",
