       "id": "CVE-2026-80489",
       "name": "OsPackageVulnerability",
       "shortDescription": {
        "text": "CVE-2026-80489: Loop with Unreachable Exit Condition ('Infinite Loop')"
       },
       "helpUri": "https://scout.docker.com/v/CVE-2026-80489?s=redhat&n=glibc&ns=redhat&t=rpm&osn=redhatlinux&osv=8&vr=%3E%3D0",
       "help": {
        "text": "A flaw was found in glibc. This vulnerability allows a remote attacker to cause a denial of service (DoS) by providing specially crafted text to an application that converts text from SHIFT_JISX0213 to UCS-4. The crafted input can lead to a continuous loop of processing, preventing the application from making progress and consuming resources. Exploitation requires specific conditions, including the application retrying conversion after an error with limited output space.\n",
        "markdown": "> A flaw was found in glibc. This vulnerability allows a remote attacker to cause a denial of service (DoS) by providing specially crafted text to an application that converts text from SHIFT_JISX0213 to UCS-4. The crafted input can lead to a continuous loop of processing, preventing the application from making progress and consuming resources. Exploitation requires specific conditions, including the application retrying conversion after an error with limited output space.\n\n|                                                                                                                                                         |\n|Package                                                                        pkg:rpm/redhat/glibc@2.28-251.el8_10.40?os_name=redhatlinux&os_version=8  |\n|Affected range                                                                 >=0                                                                       |\n|Fixed version                                                                  not fixed                                                                 |\n|[[CVSS Score 5.9] [CVSS Vector CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:H/PR:N/UI:N/S:U/C:N/I:N/A:H]]                                                                            |\n"
