       "id": "CVE-2026-3833",
       "name": "OsPackageVulnerability",
       "shortDescription": {
        "text": "CVE-2026-3833: Improper Handling of Case Sensitivity"
       },
       "helpUri": "https://scout.docker.com/v/CVE-2026-3833?s=redhat&n=gnutls&ns=redhat&t=rpm&osn=redhatlinux&osv=8&vr=%3E%3D0",
       "help": {
        "text": "A flaw was found in gnutls. This vulnerability occurs because gnutls performs case-sensitive comparisons of `nameConstraints` labels, specifically for `dNSName` (DNS) or `rfc822Name` (email) constraints within `excludedSubtrees` or `permittedSubtrees`. A remote attacker can exploit this by crafting a leaf certificate with casing differences in the Subject Alternative Name (SAN), leading to a policy bypass where a certificate that should be rejected is instead accepted. This could result in unauthorized access or information disclosure.\n",
        "markdown": "> A flaw was found in gnutls. This vulnerability occurs because gnutls performs case-sensitive comparisons of `nameConstraints` labels, specifically for `dNSName` (DNS) or `rfc822Name` (email) constraints within `excludedSubtrees` or `permittedSubtrees`. A remote attacker can exploit this by crafting a leaf certificate with casing differences in the Subject Alternative Name (SAN), leading to a policy bypass where a certificate that should be rejected is instead accepted. This could result in unauthorized access or information disclosure.\n\n|                                                                                                                                                         |\n|Package                                                                        pkg:rpm/redhat/gnutls@3.6.16-8.el8_10.6?os_name=redhatlinux&os_version=8  |\n|Affected range                                                                 >=0                                                                       |\n|Fixed version                                                                  not fixed                                                                 |\n|[[CVSS Score 6.5] [CVSS Vector CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:L/PR:N/UI:N/S:U/C:L/I:L/A:N]]                                                                            |\n"
       },
