      {
       "id": "CVE-2026-78367",
       "name": "OsPackageVulnerability",
       "shortDescription": {
        "text": "CVE-2026-78367: Improper Control of Generation of Code ('Code Injection')"
       },
       "helpUri": "https://scout.docker.com/v/CVE-2026-78367?s=redhat&n=rpm&ns=redhat&t=rpm&osn=redhatlinux&osv=8&vr=%3E%3D0",
       "help": {
        "text": "A vulnerability was found in RPM's rpmbuild tarball processing. When processing a crafted source archive, the getTarSpec() function in tools/rpmbuild.cc passes an attacker-controlled tar archive member name to rpmExpand() as part of a %{basename:...} macro expression. A specially crafted .spec member name can therefore inject RPM macros, including Lua expressions, resulting in arbitrary code execution with the privileges of the user running rpmbuild. This can be exploited when a victim or automated build system processes an attacker-controlled source tarball using rpmbuild tarball mode (such as -ts, -ta, or -tb).\n",
        "markdown": "> A vulnerability was found in RPM's rpmbuild tarball processing. When processing a crafted source archive, the getTarSpec() function in tools/rpmbuild.cc passes an attacker-controlled tar archive member name to rpmExpand() as part of a %{basename:...} macro expression. A specially crafted .spec member name can therefore inject RPM macros, including Lua expressions, resulting in arbitrary code execution with the privileges of the user running rpmbuild. This can be exploited when a victim or automated build system processes an attacker-controlled source tarball using rpmbuild tarball mode (such as -ts, -ta, or -tb).\n\n|                                                                                                                                                     |\n|Package                                                                        pkg:rpm/redhat/rpm@4.14.3-32.el8_10?os_name=redhatlinux&os_version=8  |\n|Affected range                                                                 >=0                                                                   |\n|Fixed version                                                                  not fixed                                                             |\n|[[CVSS Score 7.0] [CVSS Vector CVSS:3.1/AV:L/AC:H/PR:N/UI:R/S:U/C:H/I:H/A:H]]                                                                        |\n"
       },
       "properties": {
