       "help": {
        "text": "A flaw was found in glibc. The library's localization functions fail to properly sanitize directory traversal characters within the LANGUAGE environment variable. A local attacker capable of setting this variable across trust boundaries can force a target program to load a malicious translation file from an arbitrary filesystem location. This issue can lead to arbitrary code execution under the privileges of the running application or cause an application crash, resulting in a denial of service (DoS).\n",
