       "help": {
        "text": "A flaw was found in node-tar. An attacker can craft a malicious archive that, when extracted with default options, creates a hardlink outside the intended extraction directory. This vulnerability allows the attacker to perform arbitrary file read and write operations as the user extracting the archive, bypassing existing path protections. This can lead to unauthorized access and modification of sensitive system files.\n",
