       },
       "helpUri": "https://scout.docker.com/v/CVE-2026-94286?s=redhat&n=libXtst&ns=redhat&t=rpm&osn=redhatlinux&osv=8&vr=%3E%3D0",
       "help": {
        "text": "A flaw was found in libXtst. An out-of-bounds read vulnerability in the RECORD extension reply parser allows a malicious X server to cause a Denial of Service (DoS) by crashing connected client applications. Under certain conditions, this flaw may also result in limited information disclosure.\n",
