       "id": "CVE-2026-84782",
       "name": "OsPackageVulnerability",
       "shortDescription": {
        "text": "CVE-2026-84782: Out-of-bounds Read"
       },
       "helpUri": "https://scout.docker.com/v/CVE-2026-84782?s=redhat&n=openssl&ns=redhat&t=rpm&osn=redhatlinux&osv=8&vr=%3E%3D0",
       "help": {
        "text": "A flaw was found in OpenSSL. The Datagram Transport Layer Security (DTLS) retransmission mechanism fails to properly handle handshake message writes that are suspended before completion. A remote attacker could exploit this vulnerability during handshake message retransmission, causing OpenSSL to read past the message buffer or overwrite internal state required to resume writing. This issue can result in information disclosure through out-of-bounds memory reads or cause a Denial of Service (DoS) by crashing the process.\n",
        "markdown": "> A flaw was found in OpenSSL. The Datagram Transport Layer Security (DTLS) retransmission mechanism fails to properly handle handshake message writes that are suspended before completion. A remote attacker could exploit this vulnerability during handshake message retransmission, causing OpenSSL to read past the message buffer or overwrite internal state required to resume writing. This issue can result in information disclosure through out-of-bounds memory reads or cause a Denial of Service (DoS) by crashing the process.\n\n|                                                                                                                                                            |\n|Package                                                                        pkg:rpm/redhat/openssl@1%3A1.1.1k-17.el8_6?os_name=redhatlinux&os_version=8  |\n|Affected range                                                                 >=0                                                                          |\n|Fixed version                                                                  not fixed                                                                    |\n|[[CVSS Score 7.4] [CVSS Vector CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:H/PR:N/UI:N/S:U/C:H/I:N/A:H]]                                                                               |\n"
